  "frames": 2278,
  "duration_seconds": 75.93333333333334,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C01",
      "text": "一天一夜过去，客厅里那盒草莓先烂了，果蒂边长出一圈灰白的霉。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4035e1bd9384444f1846d58a149e0a9ceaf68b771bd8fcf6a29c6d18936ed7b2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.08025,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 153,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "fd87f21c7e6e6fc7c0b8a4a3352cf650942ed99cefed9e929dedd76dbe226b3b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "sample_count": 243852
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C02",
      "text": "安全屋里那盒，是同一批的，手机全程拍着，没人动过。我切开一颗，果肉紧实，甜得像刚买的。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "fd130d0c0d0d198989d418b6c858bf17ac37b2d8ce2eeca7c4ef4d1df3eaa8d5",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.4706875,
      "start_frame": 156,
      "end_frame": 381,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "91a269966f12b2801172c28a4d01fb4c3b552137b1cf242d0bc2d863eeb4cdb9",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "sample_count": 358593
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C03",
      "text": "东西放进去，不会坏。这意味着，我囤的每一吨米，都不用担心过期。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "68e88d7228fa47b625c00f5f20697c7919b707ff084acb85e1ba6c3733bbe9e7",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.239833333333333,
      "start_frame": 384,
      "end_frame": 542,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "8809cb99bf3551dbd4b6a1a45426fd4f739beb922056bc091fc48788136b0051",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "sample_count": 251512
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C04",
      "text": "手机又弹出一个新手演示，问我，要不要模拟屋外的威胁。我点了确认。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0451528925d670166fae1250aeb77cceca6046bb0841f31b52b8a22029d0a3f2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.931104166666667,
      "start_frame": 545,
      "end_frame": 693,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "3382944c2661e68ecbef7c084d8a54215aa5e2604380362cd889a6b5462aa471",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "sample_count": 236693
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C05",
      "text": "墙变成了一扇窗，窗外红得发暗。一道青灰色的人影扑过来，眼白通红，嘴角裂到耳根。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7d8669010036ea2680e272fb4d82eaab5f61083875f35dea22553765566352c0",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.387208333333334,
      "start_frame": 696,
      "end_frame": 888,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "a4e0d0539c07d92f88a95a1a7086ed70c1cb5879991960776587294e4d8ae621",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "sample_count": 306586
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C06",
      "text": "它撞向玻璃，被一层红光弹了回去。窗上浮出四个字，拒绝入内。我后退一步，才发现自己在咽口水。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7ed0a361d887c60b29e02a8eea3402d936ffadd1aa8631258efbb2ee2471a4aa",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.551708333333333,
      "start_frame": 891,
      "end_frame": 1118,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "c97e62c84d17ee48edeb4d2bc0446d1bb29468997aac8e6ae0a4f30b26621aae",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "sample_count": 362482
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C07",
      "text": "说明页只有三行，畏光，畏火，听觉极灵。我一笔一划，抄进本子里。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d5494d82f903e60e6a6bb848c7c1af63d72084354271d227552354aa9c916d32",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.780645833333334,
      "start_frame": 1121,
      "end_frame": 1295,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "03cb008dd2be6057d1c50a386b1ad1e7500fd27bf5d6cdc63541bd0f90be2666",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "sample_count": 277471
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C08",
      "text": "然后我开始算账。一个人活一年，最低要一百一十八万。我卡里，只有四十一万两千。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "a0ed085924e9dc3b40bd35eb8fcd1b7b3070a32ef4b26c3a95b3aefab9617ecc",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.9364375,
      "start_frame": 1298,
      "end_frame": 1477,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5c8f6ed60b1635dd97be929b6b63d4c29c17ec93438b999baf43877c4ee3ca08",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "sample_count": 284949
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C09",
      "text": "差七十六万八。而且这张表，只算了我一个人。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7f9e639e50842bdd3a4c480b68971168a887bfc4ba48f096771b66fb1b5cd846",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.447229166666667,
      "start_frame": 1480,
      "end_frame": 1584,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "1cfd606dcd7bf21d465aea63b6d2f4aed1551778cb4376e97ab6b3fd0834c69f",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "sample_count": 165467
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C10",
      "text": "我看向书架上，父母的合照。那天晚上，要是我早一点接电话，就好了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "67ae6c82481dac716201631395e9c5764cd667df20d292842e83415e17121595",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.200125,
      "start_frame": 1587,
      "end_frame": 1744,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "871a05c683bcf0553f5e55bbfc013843e00a4ca45a01a1829bc096f46a61f662",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.78025,
      "sample_count": 249606
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C11",
      "text": "这一次，我不想再来不及。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4e50a39507f4612cc44aa07fddde7677053338c732fc05000e1b19a65f88fb31",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 2.103291666666667,
      "start_frame": 1747,
      "end_frame": 1811,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "300a2fba71a659632e0408f75adb37d2914d773628c10a520e0349408f5478bc",
      "source_duration_seconds": 2.763188,
      "sample_count": 100958
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C12",
      "text": "借款软件跳出一行字，可借额度，七十八万。我盯着那个数字，忽然笑了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "12423eb9250274d07a922c18ed7c4ae2baff63768f5486c432f4f3f7de6b8357",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.4465208333333335,
      "start_frame": 1814,
      "end_frame": 1978,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "7f9a8429ff7b50fe84356315b2486ee1e1035dcade996276b641b72fb0e023df",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "sample_count": 261433
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C13",
      "text": "末世一来，钱就是废纸。到那天，欠钱的人，才是赢家。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b58e03215b7648f92928841c35f8526f002d42a443a3ba07d31bc1895c6c4c46",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.520770833333334,
      "start_frame": 1981,
      "end_frame": 2117,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C13.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "2ba7b8264fe1f64f55ebc2b6dc5ece063c716bff84288b41bae60e737cdb40dd",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.886281,
      "sample_count": 216997
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP002-C14",
      "text": "我按下申请。页面转着圈，停在审核中。从这一秒起，我没有退路了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/speed1p3/EP002-C14.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7f0012eac8b39724fc8edac3d17988e6de307e2b68526155d2bb888ae757b516",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.2429375,
      "start_frame": 2120,
      "end_frame": 2278,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP002/audio/EP002-C14.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "7d5b2d204e5f65e635dd76d16ea17f23183ce8de8b1be0cdaec3cb18f45be3d9",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "sample_count": 251661
    }
  ],
